west on v2.3.1. I ran the same rollback again and it finished.\n- All three regions now run v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** INC-0001 is open as a SEV2 for checkout-api, and the on-call engineer has been paged. My request to create it timed out, so I checked the incident list before trying again. It had been created, so I didn't send it again and page on-call twice. The incident describes the failure, the stalled first rollback and the retry, and the current state. It also lists two follow-ups:\n- find out why v2.3.1 broke\n- look into the error that stopped the first rollback", "type": "text"}]}]}